{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102530","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102530","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1410253001:1":{"text":"통신기 연결 중...","source_cn":"通讯器接通中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC209B27DCAADC639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:0::2":{"text":"마법 통신기","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410253002:0":{"text":"호건 장군님? 호건 장군님, 들리시나요?","source_cn":"霍根将军？霍根将军，你在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEF8AB892A31845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410253003:0":{"text":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","source_cn":"艾雅在上！你们总算联系我了！<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D10213A8297494F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","female":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","variant_male_record_index":"156512","variant_female_record_index":"156513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1410253003":{"text":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","source_cn":"艾雅在上！你们总算联系我了！<style=stress><player_name></style>，你们怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D10213A8297494F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","female":"듀라신이시여! 드디어 연락이 왔군! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그쪽 상황은 어떤가?","variant_male_record_index":"156512","variant_female_record_index":"156513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410253004:3":{"text":"그래서 저희는 지금 예상치 못하게 지하로 떨어졌고, 지금은 그 드워프가 지상으로 데려다주기를 기다리는 중이에요.","source_cn":"总之，我们现在意外掉到了地底，正在等那个矮人带我们回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB0A3B0920599A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410253005:0":{"text":"그렇군. 어쩐지 밖에 있던 드워프들이 허둥대더라니. 무언가 소란스러운 일이 생겼던 거였군...","source_cn":"原来是这样。怪不得外头矮人们慌成一团，多半是发现了乱子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9AB2403AAAEA50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410253006:0":{"text":"혹시 플린 쪽에서는 마스터가 사라지신 걸 알아챘나요?","source_cn":"弗林他们察觉到主人不见了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E1024C6EE18CD25","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"혹시 플린 쪽에서는 마스터가 사라지신 걸 알아챘나요?","female":"혹시 플린 쪽에서는 마스터가 사라지신 걸 알아챘나요?","variant_male_record_index":"156516","variant_female_record_index":"156517","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410253007:0":{"text":"응. 하지만 멀린은 지금 물갈이 중이라고 대충 넘겼네.","source_cn":"嗯，但我说梅林水土不服，糊弄过去了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4F38C46D0F312A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"응. 하지만 멀린은 지금 물갈이 중이라고 대충 넘겼네.","female":"응. 하지만 멀린은 지금 물갈이 중이라고 대충 넘겼네.","variant_male_record_index":"156518","variant_female_record_index":"156519","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410253008:0":{"text":"지금은 나와 플린 촌장 둘 다 모르는 척하고 있으니, 일단은 무난한 편이야. 내가 최선을 다해서 상대해 보도록 하지.","source_cn":"现在我和弗林村长互相装傻，还算安稳。我会尽力周旋一阵子——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4B517FB29B0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410253009:0":{"text":"하지만 <style=\"highlight\">깊은바위 마을과 지하 깊은 곳으로 통하는 승강기</style>라니... 이건 아주 큰 발견일세.","source_cn":"不过，<style=highlight>直接连通深岩村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D8EABF4463F16D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410253010:0":{"text":"우선 계속해서 정보를 수집해주게. 나는 자네들을 위해 다른 일들을 빈틈없이 처리하도록 하지.","source_cn":"你们先继续收集情报，我会为你们周全其他的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1616138E36897FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410253011:0":{"text":"지상으로 돌아오는 건 서두를 필요 없으니, 부디 조심하게!","source_cn":"返回地面时无需着急，千万注意安全！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B998364DB59AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410253012:0":{"text":"장군님도요, 조심하셔야 해요!"